A||N||29||Haze_Performance||Do you want your Fiero in a book?||||10||
Z||000000||Haze_Performance||07-08-2001||07:23 AM||||   OK heres the deal. I have a friend that's pressuring me to write a Fiero book. Nothing spectacular... Just a book about the Fiero history in pictures. All years & color combos. Info and facts about each model year. So heres what I decided to do. I'm going to collect pictures of each year with all its color combos & I'm going to create a page on my website. As soon as I have all the info and photos of STOCK Fieros, They will be compiled into the book. I'm even thinking of having the last chapter dedicated to modified Fieros.. I'm not going to name the places that you can get the mods.. Just nice photos of custom cars..<P><BR>Heres what I need first... BONE STOCK Fiero pics. I'm looking for every year & color combo.. Must be stock (Or at least stock looking in the photo) In the book I will give credit to the car owners. When you post a photo leave your first, last name & your city & state. I will add you name to your photo. If you cant or don't want to post youy photos here... you can send them to me at purplehazeracing@yahoo.com . I will only use photos that people post or send me.. I'm not going to pull any pics off the web of cars that I don't know the owners of. Please let me know what you think & if you have any ideas about the books content.. <P>I will keep everyone up to date with my progress.<P><BR>Thank You<BR><I>Haze</I>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/classicfieroowners3.gif">     </A><BR><I><B>Click above to visit my website.</B></I><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 07-08-2001).]||||reg||10
